WEBVTT

00:09:59.916 --> 00:10:03.316
to always predicate our work on logic.

00:10:03.796 --> 00:10:05.796
Because if we can do that,

00:10:05.796 --> 00:10:08.516
then we can be confident in our ability

00:10:08.516 --> 00:10:12.116
to pull off the most seemingly
magical feat of all:

00:10:12.556 --> 00:10:15.876
a recoding of our current course
on climate change

00:10:15.876 --> 00:10:18.556
and a promise for a more
sustainable future

00:10:18.596 --> 00:10:20.276
to generations to come.

00:10:21.436 --> 00:10:22.556
Thank you.

00:10:22.596 --> 00:10:26.116
(Applause)